	["Any {skill:393} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:393} at any level (10c), and so does the Junior Skinning Trainer in each starting area; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:7005} from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot skin without it. The first-hour quest of each starting area (Rascally Rodents, Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery, The Woodland Protector, Galgar's {item:11584}, A Humble Task, Marla's Last Wish) offers {item:247846} as a reward: reading it gives 2 skill, up to 15. Trade goods vendors and the junior trainers sell the {item:277114}, a four-slot bag for leather and hides (25c). If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:393}: hand it in to the skinning trainer it names once you reach skill 20, for the {spell:1229517} recipe."] = "任意本阵营 {skill:393} 训练师都可在任意等级教授初级 {skill:393}（10 铜），各起始地区的初级剥皮训练师也可以；箭头会选择最近的一位。向贸易货物商人或杂货商购买 {item:7005}：留在背包中，没有它就不能剥皮。各起始地区最初一小时内的任务（“鼠辈泛滥”、“寒脊山谷的送信任务”、“森林守护者”、高戈尔的 {item:11584}、“一件琐事”、“玛拉的遗愿”）会提供 {item:247846} 作为奖励：阅读可提升 2 点技能，最多提升至 15。贸易货物商人和初级训练师出售 {item:277114}，这是一个装皮革和毛皮的四格包（25 铜）。如果你为“广阔天地”在起始地区的营火旁坐过，当地露营向导还会提供露营 101: {skill:393}：技能达到 20 后，向任务指定的剥皮训练师交还，即可取得 {spell:1229517} 配方。",

